{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:1","answer":"霹雳一声暴动","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>每条线都是一个汉字的笔画按照笔顺首尾相连得到的“一笔画”。</p>","text":"每条线都是一个汉字的笔画按照笔顺首尾相连得到的“一笔画”。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>这题是将每个汉字里的笔画按照笔顺首尾相连得到的“一笔画”，经过观察可以得出这些字是“西江月秋收起义末句六字”，从而得到本题答案<code>霹雳一声暴动</code>。</p>\n<p>作为参考以下是分开笔画的断点位置：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image\" data-asset-id=\"asset-6b0c1ad8c8ee2483d65fd336\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6aeb93a0e1bf4efabea06a041d2a59c8.webp\"/></p>","text":"这题是将每个汉字里的笔画按照笔顺首尾相连得到的“一笔画”，经过观察可以得出这些字是“西江月秋收起义末句六字”，从而得到本题答案\n霹雳一声暴动\n。\n\n作为参考以下是分开笔画的断点位置：","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-6b0c1ad8c8ee2483d65fd336"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":0,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":1,\"imgUrl\":\"a6692a3f15a542a2bffb02b0f702963d.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"150px\",\"left\":\"452px\"}","pgid":1,"pg_name":"序章","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/a6692a3f15a542a2bffb02b0f702963d.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-6b0c1ad8c8ee2483d65fd336","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6aeb93a0e1bf4efabea06a041d2a59c8.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6aeb93a0e1bf4efabea06a041d2a59c8.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":70830,"sha256":"5477930c7d72b7619849cb6a8cce56525adc5f6e926439f64dd912a2b450ce29","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-8d5559f5c444e8c1540ae18c","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/a6692a3f15a542a2bffb02b0f702963d.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/a6692a3f15a542a2bffb02b0f702963d.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":3882,"sha256":"c7699910a0413fc0dde5dd4d918db0470661ab75bdcb7bb4758f03554764bc9a","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]}]}
